{% if length(memories) > 0 %}
## What is also on their mind

Recent memories, newest first. Use them where they fit, but they are extra
detail rather than the point. A scheme that ignores them is fine if it fits the
person; a scheme that fits a memory but not the person is not.

{% for m in memories %}- {{ m }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

## People
{% for a in actors %}{{ a.index }}. {{ a.name }} — {{ a.relation }}{% if length(a.standing) > 0 %}, {{ a.standing }}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}

{% if length(items) > 0 %}
## Objects
{% for i in items %}{{ i.index }}. {{ i.name }} ({{ i.category }})
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

{% if length(factions) > 0 %}
## Organisations
{% for f in factions %}{{ f.index }}. {{ f.name }}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}

Decide what {{ mastermind.name }} is ultimately after, the one concrete thing
they are doing about it now, and how they go about it. Answer with the object.
[ end user ]
